# Every PR needs a review from an owner listed here.
#
# IMPORTANT: keep this a REAL, resolvable owner. GitHub
# SILENTLY IGNORES an owner it cannot resolve — an unknown user or a team that
# does not exist produces no error, no warning, and no review requirement. The
# file then looks like a review gate while enforcing nothing at all, which is
# strictly worse than having no CODEOWNERS: you believe you are protected.
#
# Use a real GitHub handle (@someone) or a team that actually exists in the org
# (@OregonAI/team-name — check with: gh api orgs/OregonAI/teams).
* @morficflux

